OL,3,GNEWSABathing warning issued for several
OL,4,Aisland beaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been warned not to swim at
OL,7,Fseveral Isle of Wight beaches because
OL,8,Fof water pollution.
OL,10,FThe Environment Agency has issued a
OL,11,Fbathing water alert for Gurnard on the
OL,12,Fnorth of the island and along the east
OL,13,Fcoast in the Shanklin and Bembridge
OL,14,Fareas.
OL,16,FSouthern Water's River and Seas Watch
OL,17,Fwebsite details outfall releases
OL,18,Faffecting bathing waters across all the
OL,19,Fareas.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
