OL,3,GNEWSABathing warning issued for several
OL,4,Aisland beaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsle of Wight Council has advised
OL,7,Fanyone who comes into contact with
OL,8,Fcontaminated water to wash with soap
OL,9,Fand water. It has warned that hand
OL,10,Fsanitiser does not kill all the viruses
OL,11,Fthat can cause illness.
